@startuml Sequence Diagram - Forgot Password

actor "User" as User
participant "ForgotPasswordView" as ForgotView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "EmailVerification" as EmailVerify
participant "Backend" as Backend

User -> ForgotView : 1 Open forgot password page
activate ForgotView
ForgotView -> ForgotView : 2 Display forgot password form

User -> ForgotView : 3 Enter email
User -> ForgotView : 4 Click "Send Reset Link" button

ForgotView -> ForgotView : 5 Validate email format

alt [Invalid email]
    ForgotView -> ForgotView : 6 Error notification
    ForgotView -> User : 7 Display error notification
else [Valid email]
    ForgotView -> ClerkAuth : 8 Send reset request
    activate ClerkAuth

    ClerkAuth -> ClerkAuth : 9 Check email existence

    alt [Email not found]
        ClerkAuth -> ForgotView : 10 Error notification
        ForgotView -> ForgotView : 11 Error notification
        ForgotView -> User : 12 Display error notification
    else [Email found]
        ClerkAuth -> ClerkAuth : 13 Generate reset token
        ClerkAuth -> User : 14 Send reset email
        ClerkAuth -> ForgotView : 15 Reset link sent notification
        ForgotView -> EmailVerify : 16 Display reset link sent screen
        activate EmailVerify

        User -> EmailVerify : 17 Check email & click reset link
        EmailVerify -> ClerkAuth : 18 Verify reset token

        ClerkAuth -> ClerkAuth : 19 Token valid?
        alt [Invalid/Expired token]
            ClerkAuth -> EmailVerify : 20 Error notification
            EmailVerify -> User : 21 Display error notification
        else [Valid token]
            ClerkAuth -> EmailVerify : 22 Show reset password form
            User -> EmailVerify : 23 Enter new password
            User -> EmailVerify : 24 Submit new password
            EmailVerify -> ClerkAuth : 25 Update password

            ClerkAuth -> ClerkAuth : 26 Confirm password update
            ClerkAuth -> Backend : 27 Invalidate old sessions
            activate Backend
            Backend -> Backend : 28 Invalidate sessions
            Backend -> ClerkAuth : 29 Confirmation
            deactivate Backend

            ClerkAuth -> EmailVerify : 30 Success notification
            EmailVerify -> User : 31 Display success message
        end
        deactivate EmailVerify
    end
    deactivate ClerkAuth
end

deactivate ForgotView

@enduml
